Ohm’s ordinary bolt repeatedly stunned the turret with the move off. With it on, the turret fired zero rounds during short circuits but 8–10 rounds in the immunity gaps. Its frontal pistol multiplier stayed at 0.25. Kerf killed the 10 HP shield robot on tick 1 either way because even the blocked slice dealt 19.8 damage. Pistol kills left zero damage to carry. Against a 6 HP robot thug, the hand cannon carried 2 HP to a surviving neighbour, so rank 2 had no second kill to chain from.

